Output textarea_custom.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 1550
Set Height 450

Type@30ms "./examples/textarea_custom"
Sleep 100ms  Enter
Sleep 1s
Type@100ms "* Update Readme.ms"
Enter
Type@100ms "* Fixed a bug"
Enter
Type@100ms "* Updated dependencies"
Enter
Type@100ms "* Implemented a feature
Enter
Up@200ms 4
Sleep 200ms
Ctrl+E
Sleep 200ms
Backspace
Sleep 200ms
Type d